 "_help_extra": "extra (P9-04b): animations only some sheets carry (sheets = the base sheets; a recolor or star jersey carries what its pages' sheet carries). Their frames are on extra pages <sheet>_x<N>.png after the normal pages: start = the logical extra column (extra_cols in all, pages of page_cols, the same rows and palettes as the normal pages). Events as above, plus top (the ball over the head). hook: right-hand hook shot, left shoulder to the hoop. fadeaway: turnaround fadeaway jumper off the left hand; post (back to the hoop), turn (the pivot), rise, top; fade [first, last] = the frames over which the game moves him fade_ft feet back (the art stays over his floor point). stepback: step-back jumper off the left hand; plant, hop, then today's jumper; fade [first, last] = the frames over which the game slides him fade_ft feet back. eurostep: Euro-step into today's right-hand layup; steps [first, second]; euro_path = [frame, feet to his left] points the game moves him through, eased. cradle: cradle dunk, right hand (Rooftop's signature dunk): scooped off the right hip, cradled in the bent arm [cradle], rocked back behind the head (hang), thrown down; the dunk events of dunk_windmill.",
